WEBVTT

00:20:28.916 --> 00:20:32.276
AF: First of all, I’m not retiring
in the classic sense.

00:20:32.276 --> 00:20:34.116
As my wife, says, David,

00:20:34.156 --> 00:20:38.076
I’m “rewiring,” not retiring,

00:20:38.076 --> 00:20:40.276
because I do intend to be very active.

00:20:40.276 --> 00:20:43.636
And that was one of the reasons
why I stepped down

00:20:43.676 --> 00:20:45.996
at this point in time.

00:20:46.036 --> 00:20:48.716
Because while I still have the enthusiasm,

00:20:48.756 --> 00:20:51.596
the energy and thank goodness,
the good health

00:20:51.636 --> 00:20:54.236
to be able to do something else
for the next few years,

00:20:54.276 --> 00:21:00.156
I want to use the benefit
of my experience of being at the NIH